{"ticker":{"symbol":"067830.KS","name":"세이브존I&C","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2195.0,"change_pct":0.006880733944954143,"market_cap":82712649728.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.01366742596810934,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":4135.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Department Stores","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://esavezone.co.kr","business_summary":"Savezone I&C Corporation engages in the operation of fashion discount stores in South Korea. The company also operates convenience facilities, such as laundry, pharmacy, food court, art gallery, as well as Tap Play Coffee, a specialty coffee shop and Happy Day Festival, a café. In addition, it is involved in the operation of Save Zone Flower, which offers gifts, flowers, and potted plants; gift certificate dispensers; repair shop; specialty restaurant district; and Save Zone Sports Center, a fitness center. The company was formerly known as Uless Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Savezone I&C Corporation in 2004. Savezone I&C Corporation was founded in 2002 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"세이브존아이앤씨주식회사는 대한민국에서 패션 할인점을 운영하고 있습니다. 또한, 세탁실, 약국, 푸드코트, 미술관 등 편의시설을 운영하고 있으며, 스페셜티 커피숍인 탭플레이 커피와 카페인 해피데이 페스티벌도 운영하고 있습니다. 또한, 선물, 꽃, 화분 등을 제공하는 세이브존플라워 운영에도 참여하고 있습니다. 상품권 발행기; 수리점; 전문 레스토랑 지구; 피트니스 센터인 세이브 존 스포츠 센터(Save Zone Sports Center)도 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Uless Co., Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2004년에 Savezone I&C Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. Savezone I&C Corporation은 2002년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"백화점","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":119350275140.0,"operating_income":9219026650.0,"net_income":9179409940.0,"eps":243.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":123786863300.0,"operating_income":11043747530.0,"net_income":13617966610.0